{#
  One JSON-LD @graph: LodgingBusiness/EventVenue + WebSite + WebPage + FAQPage.
  Built in JS (see eleventy.config.js "schemaGraph" shortcode) rather than
  assembled here, since Nunjucks has no clean way to conditionally merge
  optional fields (geo, email, checkIn/Out, sameAs) into an object.
  Deliberately no AggregateRating/Review node (Section 7.3: self-serving
  reviews are not eligible for rich results) and no VacationRental type
  (restricted to Hotel Center partners).
#}
<script type="application/ld+json">{% schemaGraph site, copy, faq, buildDate %}</script>
